Z||000006||Cheever3000||10-04-2001||11:12 PM||||Regarding membership costs, here's a little news for you...<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Something that might be of interest to all of you at this time is we as the board decided to reduce membership in the month of October to $25.00.<BR>The reason for this, is that some clubs have not yet voted to join and if you join and are not affiliated with a club, dues would be $40.00.<BR>So we are giving everybody the incentive to join at affiliated club price.<BR>So what are you waiting for!!!! Sign-up now and save.<BR>Remember, this club is for you and run by the membership.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That came from the announcement of the new club, which you may have missed.  Here it is...<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010439.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010439.html</A> <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Cheever3000||10-04-2001||11:16 PM||||Oh, and there's a link to "Fiero Parts Vendors" at the very top of any Forum screen.  Hope that helps.<BR>||||reg||1
